msgctxt "search:search_EA7B882C_C77E_48DC_95BF_60A87ECDA9C5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫What’s the matter?⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫You "
"lost, or you just tryin’ to take in the sights?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫Qual è il problema?⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Ti "
"sei perso? O stavi solo dando un’occhiata in giro?"

#: search:search_703E19E0_726C_433E_BAC7_50B93A16C2B7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ca865a6011e605b3b1872f066ce47342e4691d0dbcf15ba0beb75fb023fdf00c
#. default-sha256: b6739d64864a0c7ee63db5284e0e21451f09bab9e4d35fda5f385e85de88c02f
msgctxt "search:search_703E19E0_726C_433E_BAC7_50B93A16C2B7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫A voice called out to ⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫the Departed⟪k:3⟫—⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫but it was not the Maid’s "
"voice."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Una voce ⟪k:1⟫Ti stava chiamando⟪k:2⟫stava chiamando il Defunto⟪k:3⟫—⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫ma non era la "
"voce della Domestica."

#: search:search_93F85EDE_C4D7_4905_B000_4CBEB0BF467F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1e7de05eac1b5e7bf2b467d14e47c5e233fc012183f9db126388996f377947b6
