msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫...What?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫...Cosa?"

#: search:search_B07EC243_739B_4E71_8C88_18A02077BB67
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1c71be74c7bcf3e35ca11a541c5eacf5e1b46e7df213e2d67a933904c4db700a
#. default-sha256: ac2a3245a88ca75636d06376cdb02fc53e6d69ae0076968fbddfa643df721d48
msgctxt "search:search_B07EC243_739B_4E71_8C88_18A02077BB67"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Caught off-guard, ⟪k:2⟫You⟪k:3⟫he⟪k:4⟫ spun around, confused, in search of the source."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Colto di sorpresa, ⟪k:2⟫Ti guardasti attorno⟪k:3⟫si guardò intorno⟪k:4⟫, confuso, in "
"cerca della sua origine."

#: search:search_30150091_426D_424D_BA43_80800C085731
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f46df421af9d206da22d435760b285d024fd018deb2139648a1d39ce206c1338
#. default-sha256: 8ad290635a0742abe8a95f5552d93a8389bcbcd0b7c4dc43b2d23e66192c2590
msgctxt "search:search_30150091_426D_424D_BA43_80800C085731"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Where you looking?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I’m over here. Yeah, there you go.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Little more to the "
"left."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Dove stai guardando?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Sono qui. ⟪k:3⟫Ecco, ci sei quasi.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Un po’ più a "
"sinistra."

#: search:search_49F955BE_4E05_4E8D_ABE8_12721B082B88
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a40dcbeceea8d23ee02fceaa9b213b960dd0e516faf14392e81f41c1344d4281
#. default-sha256: 2c1951c027d437f1dd0074ea4abc6a2c7bcff36fc9efdf7864a89b579c65a70e
msgctxt "search:search_49F955BE_4E05_4E8D_ABE8_12721B082B88"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Following the voice’s instructions, ⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫he⟪k:3⟫ found ⟪k:4⟫Yourself⟪k:5⟫"
"himself⟪k:6⟫ facing a wall."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Seguendo le istruzioni della voce, ⟪k:1⟫Ti ritrovasti⟪k:2⟫si ritrovò⟪k:3⟫ rivolto verso una "
"parete."

