msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You look like you’ve just seen a ghost!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Hey now! Come on, don’t turn away!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Sembra che tu abbia appena visto un fantasma!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫...Eddai, no! Non voltarmi le "
"spalle!"

