msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Yep, you got it.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I’m the one talkin’ to you."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Già, proprio così.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Sono io che ti sto parlando."

#: search:search_0E103304_6ED7_4229_9C7D_927531562BB9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b62fc86ded2a1d17aa31f65f53277893ef5cd91e920fe4d63d6c09ce943baf28
