msgid "⟪k:0⟫The voice was coming from within the painting."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫La voce proveniva dall’interno del dipinto."

#: search:search_D919F848_50E7_4423_9AA1_62B2AEE0FA02
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c6e60bf06500940ed2c33464981d14d6d275971db81e33d7a78bc97c24e21ddd
#. default-sha256: ab9b998bec541b4b78a22ded688adfa8d539033c48355a4b8b4ace163c15324f
msgctxt "search:search_D919F848_50E7_4423_9AA1_62B2AEE0FA02"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫When ⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫the Departed⟪k:3⟫ had passed by this wall on ⟪k:4⟫Your⟪k:5⟫his⟪k:6⟫ way to "
"the third door,⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫ ⟪k:10⟫a magnificent landscape painting had been hanging there."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Quando ⟪k:1⟫eri⟪k:2⟫il Defunto era⟪k:3⟫ passato di fianco a quel muro la prima volta, mentre "
"⟪k:4⟫Ti stavi⟪k:5⟫si stava⟪k:6⟫ dirigendo verso la terza porta, il dipinto ritraeva un magnifico "
"paesaggio."

#: search:search_C4E222F0_ECAB_4708_90BE_7BC639B4E253
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9dba0916c65b8e791e35cad26d6ff9f354a0c48af83f76136cab325b1cf3483e
#. default-sha256: 5161c8d2d3ba509636038d76b45d509fb9e41b79e0def80319bcbac2f0980d48
msgctxt "search:search_C4E222F0_ECAB_4708_90BE_7BC639B4E253"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But now, the canvas was a deep shade of black, as if it had been dipped into a vat of ink."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ma in quel momento, la tela era ricoperta da un’intensa tonalità di nero, come se fosse "
"stata immersa in una vasca d’inchiostro."

#: search:search_E274FD87_12D4_4405_8215_FA3F45F727AD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2e856c2ccddb565f8a2325dcf0547a9a4ea64eac38e926b3a651a4bc1228fd45
#. default-sha256: e2399d7da8de045c28697f23d8a8b67ce9abb79709a92f46d73164a196318d16
msgctxt "search:search_E274FD87_12D4_4405_8215_FA3F45F727AD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Been a while since I’ve talked to anyone.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫So tell me, you can hear me all right, "
"can’tcha?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫È⟪k:2⟫ da un bel po’ che non parlo con qualcuno.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Dimmi, riesci a sentirmi "
"forte e chiaro?"

#: search:search_3A7FA097_8099_4B4C_90DB_0DE1D276157B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e38ba26af21ccfd031609b7ee760e850308ba597b4379a23689fccb2ba96e495
